p08 : US Blanks 7'9"H (2010 catalog vector extraction; target 71.7 L)
p97 : Designed for retro funshapes. Based on feedback from 7’11”H and 8’4”H, improvements were made in the thickness and foil. Should accomodate many rockers and be an easy hand or machine shape blank.
